[[0,1338509,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-11T01:04:50","Hitlore","",[],"","Devin Faraci sexually assaults woman, admits to it, GAF disowns him. What about Tyler?","http://www.neogaf.com/forum/showthread.php?t=1291754","NeoFAG"],[1,6533901,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-11T01:20:39","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/vDdlY\">https://archive.is/vDdlY</a> : \r</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Birth.Movies.Death Editor In Chief (Devin Faraci) in Hot Water - NeoGAF </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&quot;Didn't see a thread so thought I'd make one for this.Editor-in-Chief of Birth.Movies.Death, Devin Faraci is in some internet hot water today after a claim from a fellow twitter user involving something he allegedly did at a bar years ago.Devin runs the very popular pop culture and movie site and frequently speaks out against Gaters/Men's Rights types and is a supporter of feminism.Link below for his normal tweet against Trump followed by an accusation from a twitter user about being fingerbanged at a bar by him.&quot; </p>\n<p>'From the accuser, he stuck his hand down her pants and grabbed her pussy. ' </p>\n<p>'He then went back to his friends and asked them to smell his finger. ', &quot; His response is that he doesn't remember doing this and is sorry.As is normally the case when something happens on the internet, he has been taken offline and therefore radio silent.(I'd post images and screen caps but I'm not home and I'm on mobile)A shame if true as I'm a big fan of his website and like getting news from him.&quot; </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/u0eLPL.jpg\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6534359,0,4,0,4,"2016-10-11T02:39:53","Bruce_Jenners_Balls","",[],"<p>I don't know who this is but is he one of their own? The left will always cannibalize.</p>"],[1,6534880,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-11T04:09:20","capturadorculo","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i1QlkphbiuI\">all you need to know about devin faraci</a></p>"],[1,6535041,0,5,0,5,"2016-10-11T04:50:24","KevinArnold","",[],"<p>self-cannibalizing it's what they will all do. The fetish is they love throwing their self-righteous ways against everyone else but don't look in their own closet and within that closet is SJW waiting to devour, it's basically like a fucking SITH there can only be one, these fucks have to SJW each other until one is weak and the strongest SJW ends up betraying them taking over.</p>"],[2,6539518,6535041,1,0,1,"2016-10-11T19:42:09","nomenimion","",[],"<p>There can be two Sith.</p>"],[3,6540652,6539518,0,0,0,"2016-10-11T22:20:07","ThisIsWhoWeR","",[],"<p>But only one master, I think he means.</p>\n<p>Anyway, a better analogy is Highlander.</p>"],[1,6535583,0,4,0,4,"2016-10-11T07:19:14","SpaceC0w","",[],"<p>At this point I think it's safe to assume that if a man's an outspoken feminist, he's covering for some awful thing he's done to women in the past.</p>\n<p>And we should let it sink in that this guy IMMEDIATELY believed his accuser and apologized. He took the official feminist course of action. And this is what they do to him. You should NEVER apologize to the SJWs. It's like bleeding in shark-infested water.</p>"],[2,6535833,6535583,2,0,2,"2016-10-11T09:02:34","UncleDoug","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>At this point I think it's safe to assume that if a man's an outspoken feminist, he's covering for some awful thing he's done to women in the past.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This through and through, you absolutely nailed it.</p>"],[1,6539510,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-11T19:41:24","nomenimion","[e]",[],"<p>In fairness, he said he didn't remember this... he didn't deny it, of course. It's at least possible that this didn't go down the way she said it did.</p>\n<p>Nonetheless, I share your glee at this asshole's predicament.</p>"]]
