[[0,1338513,0,5,0,5,"2016-10-11T01:06:14","LemonCookie24","",[],"","Elderly woman dies from injuries sustained in home invasion robbery in San Jose","http://www.latimes.com/local/lanow/la-me-elderly-woman-beating-death-20161008-snap-story.html","USNews"],[1,6533910,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-11T01:22:40","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/6GoT3\">https://archive.is/6GoT3</a> : \r</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Elderly woman dies from injuries sustained in home invasion robbery in San Jose - LA Times </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>'An 88-year-old San Jose woman who was brutally beaten during a home invasion robbery last month died early Saturday from injuries she suffered in the attack, according to the Santa Clara County Sheriff’s Office. ' </p>\n<p>'Investigators arrested Cuen Sept. 15. ' </p>\n<p>'According to Cardenas, a man entered Douglas’ home and threatened to kill her if she didn’t give him money. ' </p>\n<p>'The violent attack was reported by a neighbor shortly before 8 p.m. in the 200 block of North Cragmont Avenue in East San Jose. ' </p>\n<p>'Now that Douglas has died, Cuen will soon be charged with murder, according to the Sheriff’s Office. ' </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/NAu81l.png\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"]]
