[[0,1338515,0,4,2,2,"2016-10-11T01:08:50","Hindex","",[],"<p>Tax Foundation: <a href=\"http://taxfoundation.org/article/details-and-analysis-donald-trump-s-tax-plan\">http://taxfoundation.org/article/details-and-analysis-donald-trump-s-tax-plan</a></p>\n<p>Tax Policy Center: <a href=\"http://www.taxpolicycenter.org/publications/analysis-donald-trumps-tax-plan\">http://www.taxpolicycenter.org/publications/analysis-donald-trumps-tax-plan</a></p>","Two independent reviews found Giant Douche's tax plan would cut revenue by about $1trln a year and increase deficit","","politics"],[1,6533964,0,4,0,4,"2016-10-11T01:30:17","Ah_Pook","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>Giant Douche \n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>It's a sad state of affairs when I have to click to figure out which one you're talking about.</p>"],[2,6534669,6533964,1,0,1,"2016-10-11T03:35:02","brandon816","[e]",[],"<p>It's a South Park reference. He just made another post before that where he called Clinton a turd sandwich. The point being that he feels there is no real difference between the two, and that he doesn't want either for president.</p>"],[3,6534872,6534669,1,0,1,"2016-10-11T04:07:27","Ah_Pook","",[],"<p>Right, and I agree.</p>"],[1,6534679,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-11T03:36:28","pcdude","",[],"<p>What better way to force a few government departments out of service than by cutting off the cash when it runs out. </p>"]]
